      "body": "<!--e57a25ab6845829454e8d69fc972939a-->\n\nThe following sections might be updated with supplementary metadata relevant to reviewers and maintainers.\n\n<!--006a51241073e994b41acfe9ec718e94-->\n### Code Coverage & Benchmarks\nFor details see: https://corecheck.dev/bitcoin/bitcoin/pulls/36066.\n<!--021abf342d371248e50ceaed478a90ca-->\n### Reviews\nSee [the guideline](https://github.com/bitcoin/bitcoin/blob/master/CONTRIBUTING.md#code-review) and [AI policy](https://github.com/bitcoin/bitcoin/blob/master/doc/AI_POLICY.md) for information on the review process.\nA summary of reviews will appear here.\n<!--174a7506f384e20aa4161008e828411d-->\n### Conflicts\nReviewers, this pull request conflicts with the following ones:\n\n* [#36000](https://github.com/bitcoin/bitcoin/pull/36000) (validation: prefetch blocks while connecting by l0rinc)\n* [#35751](https://github.com/bitcoin/bitcoin/pull/35751) (validation: use parallel input prevout fetching in TestBlockValidity by andrewtoth)\n* [#35570](https://github.com/bitcoin/bitcoin/pull/35570) (refactor: Change some validation.cpp methods to return BlockValidationState by optout21)\n* [#35511](https://github.com/bitcoin/bitcoin/pull/35511) (RFC: consensus: Make `CAmount` a class by hodlinator)\n\nIf you consider this pull request important, please also help to review the conflicting pull requests. Ideally, start with the one that should be merged first.\n<!--5faf32d7da4f0f540f40219e4f7537a3-->",
