      "author_association": "CONTRIBUTOR",
      "body": "What about the mutability and mutations of the `Chainstate` (the implicit `this` argument)?\r\nWith the proposed change, calling `TestConnectBlock` still has the side effect of mutating `num_blocks_total`, for example.\r\n\r\nPlease have a look at https://github.com/bitcoin/bitcoin/issues/35904, which proposes extracting the block validation parts from `ConnectBlock` into a function that has no side effects.",
